     Notes:
     - Default v2 graph starts from one root face; one user plus action creates one child, with return-flange defaults from non-return parents and mounting-flange -90 defaults from return flanges.
     - Face addition is only triggered by the visible edge + chip; session autosave stays browser-local until explicit save.
     - Added canvas-local designer undo/redo, absolute onboarding callouts, left-rail document controls, draggable inline popups with inline close controls, document-level section drag release, outward-positive offset geometry, and theme-safe SVG overlay label fills.

     [2026-01-09] Reworked CassetteDesigner component.
