     Notes:
     - Extracted Nodi3D graph building logic to a separate utility.
     - Implemented a more structured state management for cassette data (params and extrusions).
     - Improved UI with a side panel for editing parameters and managing extrusion history.
     - SVG rendering is now driven by the high-level cassette data.

*** User Notes
    Colors in your component don't follow project conventions. Global parameters are not global parameters but just root node dimensions.
